, mobile and local search\"}]},{\"t\":\"p\",\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t00052\",\"v\":\"Quick fixes on today's site in four weeks, then a headless rebuild in Next.js: clinic finder, clinic pages with Healthier SG enrolment, a Healthier SG hub, mobile speed of 90+. Then a monthly local SEO retainer across 21 clinics.\"}]},{\"t\":\"span\",\"a\":{\"class\":\"meta\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t00053\",\"v\":\"Go-live Week 12 \u00b7 retainer from Week 13\"}]}]},{\"t\":\"div\",\"a\":{\"class\":\"card\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"span\",\"a\":{\"class\":\"ws-tag\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t00054\",\"v\":\"WS2 \u00b7 Qualitas Health SG\"}]},{\"t\":\"h3\",\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t00055\",\"v\":\"Group website revamp\"}]},{\"t\":\"p\",\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t00056\",\"v\":\"A branded group site that showcases Frontier, IMC, Smile Focus, GPA and the heartland clinics, with one clinic and doctor finder and direct booking links into each brand.\"}]},{\"t\":\"span\",\"a\":{\"class\":\"meta\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t00057\",\"v\":\"Go-live Week 16\"}]}]},{\"t\":\"div\",\"a\":{\"class\":\"card\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"span\",\"a\":{\"class\":\"ws-tag\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t00058\",\"v\":\"WS3 \u00b7 IMC\"}]},{\"t\":\"h3\",\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t00059\",\"v\":\"IMC website revamp\"}]},{\"t\":\"p\",\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t00060\",\"v\":\"A new approach for IMC in a tighter expat market: doctors and languages up front, insurer direct billing made easy to check, five clinics, five languages.\"}]},{\"t\":\"span\",\"a\":{\"class\":\"meta\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t00061\",\"v\":\"Discovery after the IMC introduction \u00b7 go-live Week 22\"}]}]},{\"t\":\"div\",\"a\":{\"class\":\"card\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"span\",\"a\":{\"class\":\"ws-tag\"},\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t00062\",\"v\":\"WS4 \u00b7 Corporate\"}]},{\"t\":\"h3\",\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t00063\",\"v\":\"Corporate business programme\"}]},{\"t\":\"p\",\"k\":[{\"t\":\"#\",\"id\":\"t0006